          "final_text": "To determine the percentage of the total contractual obligations that are related to global headquarters operating leases as of December 31, 2013, I need to find the relevant information in the document.\n\nLooking at the \"Contractual Obligations\" section, I find the following table:\n\n| (in thousands) | Total | Within 1 year | 2 – 3 years | 4 – 5 years | After 5 years |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Global headquarters operating leases^(1) | $68,389 | $1,429 | $8,556 | $8,556 | $49,848 |\n| Other operating leases^(2) | 35,890 | 11,401 | 12,045 | 5,249 | 7,195 |\n| Unconditional purchase obligations^(3) | 3,860 | 2,872 | 988 | — | — |\n| Obligations related to uncertain tax positions, including interest and penalties^(4) | 933 | 933 | — | — | — |\n| Other long-term obligations^(5) | 35,463 | 11,140 | 17,457 | 3,780 | 3,086 |\n| Total contractual obligations | $144,535 | $27,775 | $39,046 | $17,585 | $60,129 |\n\nThe global headquarters operating leases total $68,389 thousand, and the total contractual obligations total $144,535 thousand.\n\nTo find the percentage:\n(68,389 / 144,535) * 100 = 47.31%\n\nSo, as of December 31, 2013, the global headquarters operating leases represented 47.31% of the total contractual obligations.\n\nFINAL: 47.31%",
